-- `faceVertices[6][4]`: Maps face indices to 4 vertex indices per face [S2, unofficial]:
-  - TOP: $\{3, 2, 6, 7\}$
-  - BOTTOM: $\{1, 0, 4, 5\}$
-  - LEFT: $\{4, 0, 3, 7\}$
-  - RIGHT: $\{1, 5, 6, 2\}$
-  - FRONT: $\{0, 1, 2, 3\}$
-  - BACK: $\{5, 4, 7, 6\}$
